  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.743.21 defines a data asset management framework with its corresponding objects, activities and supports. Objects of data asset management are data assets, which include master data, metadata, and other data assets. Activities include data standards management, data model management, data quality management, data security management, data valuation management, and data sharing management. To ensure the proper level of management, the corresponding people in charge, rules and regulations, and technology tools are needed.</abstract>
